 * This is a TEST fixture with the same FQN (`App\Models\User`) as the
 * canonical implementation at `playground/src/Models/User.xphp`.  When
 * the user does GTD on a `new User()` reference, the resolver should
 * prefer the canonical `src/` path over this fixture (which lives in a
 * `tests/Fixtures/` segment that scores a penalty).
 *
 * To verify:
 *   1. Open BOTH this file and `src/Models/User.xphp` in the editor.
 *   2. In any file using `new User()` (e.g. Phase3Utf16.xphp), Ctrl+Click `User`.
 *   3. The jump should land in `src/Models/User.xphp`, NOT here.
 */
final class User
{
    public function __construct(public readonly string $name)
    {
    }
}
